  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 60901b6cb00a70041af67fe7b1fee6d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcName: Old Wanderer
  interactionRadius: 2.8
  dialogueLines:
  - Greetings, traveler. You have braved the perilous chasms to reach this sanctum.
  - Deep within the fortress sleeps Ignis, the Volcanic Titan. His rocky hide is
    impenetrable, but timing your Parries and deflecting his own magma back at him
    will crack his armor!
